<view class="app-page waitlist-success-page">
  <nav-bar title="候补已提交" show-back="{{false}}" bg="#fffdf8" />

  <view class="waitlist-success-hero">
    <view class="waitlist-success-icon">
      <image class="waitlist-success-icon__image" src="/assets/icons/check.svg" />
    </view>
    <view class="waitlist-success-title">候补已提交</view>
    <view class="waitlist-success-desc">
      如有选手退赛，工作人员将按提交顺序电话联系您。候补不收取费用，确认名额后需重新完成报名支付。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="waitlist-success-card">
    <view class="waitlist-success-row">
      <text class="waitlist-success-row__label">赛事</text>
      <text class="waitlist-success-row__value">{{eventName}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="waitlist-success-row">
      <text class="waitlist-success-row__label">组别 / 舞种</text>
      <text class="waitlist-success-row__value">{{groupText}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="waitlist-success-row">
      <text class="waitlist-success-row__label">选手</text>
      <text class="waitlist-success-row__value">{{playerName}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="waitlist-success-row">
      <text class="waitlist-success-row__label">排队序号</text>
      <text class="waitlist-success-row__value waitlist-success-row__value--strong">
        第 {{positionNo}} 位
      </text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="waitlist-success-note">
    可在「我的 - 我的候补」查看排队状态；排队中可自助取消，取消仅移出队列，不涉及退款。
  </view>

  <view class="waitlist-success-actions">
    <button class="app-btn app-btn--primary" bind:tap="onGoWaitlists">查看我的候补</button>
    <button class="app-btn" bind:tap="onGoEvents">返回赛事列表</button>
  </view>
</view>
